# Error reporting via `check` for malformed input.
# Unexpected end of file at a value position.
```console
$ ar7json check tests/fixtures/eof-value.ar7
? 1
ar7json: unexpected end of file; expected ["value"]

```

# Unexpected end of file inside an object block (missing closing brace).
```console
$ ar7json check tests/fixtures/eof-block.ar7
? 1
ar7json: unexpected end of file; expected ["'}'", "entry"]

```

# Unterminated string becomes a general lexer error.
```console
$ ar7json check tests/fixtures/unterminated-string.ar7
? 1
ar7json: unterminated string starting at position 6 (line 1, column 7)

```

# General error: list longer than the allowed maximum.
```console
$ ar7json check tests/fixtures/max-list.ar7
? 1
ar7json: maximum list length exceeded

```
